@startuml
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam ParticipantPadding 20
skinparam BoxPadding 10
autonumber

participant "GraphQL Client" as Client
participant "Applicant" as Applicant
participant "OraApplication\nGraphQLResource" as Resource
participant "OraApplication\nService" as AppService
participant "OraApplication\nRepository" as AppRepo
participant "OraExam1Report\nService" as ReportService
participant "Caffeine Cache\n(ora-reports-by-vacancy)" as Caffeine
participant "MasterData\nCache" as MasterData
participant "MongoDB" as Mongo

== Report Fetch / Subscribe ==

Client -> Resource: Query / Subscribe Report (vacancyId)
Resource -> ReportService: getOrBuildReport(vacancyId)

ReportService -> Caffeine: Check cache
alt Cache Hit
    Caffeine --> ReportService: Return Cached Report
else Cache Miss
    Caffeine --> ReportService: No Data
    ReportService -> Mongo: reportRepo.findByVacancyId()
    alt Not in DB
        ReportService -> ReportService: rebuildReport()
        ReportService -> AppRepo: fetch applications for vacancyId
        AppRepo --> ReportService: List of OraApplication
        
        loop for each application
            ReportService -> MasterData: lookup community & gender mapping
            MasterData --> ReportService: normalized labels
        end
        
        ReportService -> Mongo: persistOrUpdate(newReport)
    end
    ReportService --> Caffeine: Store Result in Cache
end

ReportService --> Resource: Return OraExam1Report
Resource --> Client: GraphQL Response / Stream

== Application Update & Cache Invalidation ==

Applicant -> Resource: Mutation (create or update Application)
Resource -> AppService: createApplication / update
AppService -> AppRepo: persist() / update()
AppRepo -> Mongo: save application data

note right of AppRepo
  AppRepo overrides persist/update
  to trigger report rebuild
end note

AppRepo -> ReportService: refreshFromApplication(entity)
ReportService -> ReportService: refreshForVacancy(vacancyId)

note right of ReportService
  Cache invalidation is triggered
  evicting the specific vacancyId
end note
ReportService -> Caffeine: Evict cache for vacancyId

ReportService -> ReportService: rebuildReport(vacancyId, true)
ReportService -> AppRepo: fetch applications
AppRepo --> ReportService: List of OraApplication
ReportService -> MasterData: lookup mappings
ReportService -> Mongo: persistOrUpdate(updatedReport)

note right of ReportService
  Publish to GraphQL 
  Subscription Emitters
end note
ReportService -> Client: Push updated OraExam1Report stream

@enduml
